  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Capacity for Diaspora Engagement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program objective is to enhance the capacity of the Diaspora Unit in the Ministry of Foreign Affairs to implement their core functions to mobilize Ugandan Diaspora to contribute to national development with a specific focus on the infrastructure sector. The objective of the IDF Grant is to enhance the capacity of staff in the Diaspora Division in the Ministry of Foreign Affairs (MoFA) and Agencies to engage Ugandan Diaspora in infrastructure development support in selected focus areas i.e. energycomma roads and railways.</narrative>
  </description>
